@startuml
title Use Case Diagram - Parallel Search System

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Administrator" as Admin
actor "User" as User
actor "Ollama LLM" as LLM

rectangle "Parallel Search System" {

  usecase "Build inverted index" as UC1
  usecase "Configure thread count" as UC2
  usecase "View system statistics" as UC3
  usecase "Check server health" as UC4

  usecase "Search documents" as UC5
  usecase "Expand query with LLM" as UC6
  usecase "Keyword search" as UC7
  usecase "View search results" as UC8
  usecase "Track search progress" as UC9

}

Admin -- UC1
Admin -- UC2
Admin -- UC3
Admin -- UC4

User -- UC5
User -- UC8
User -- UC9

UC1 ..> UC2 : <<include>>
UC5 ..> UC6 : <<include>>
UC5 ..> UC7 : <<include>>
UC5 ..> UC8 : <<include>>

UC9 ..> UC5 : <<extend>>

LLM -- UC6

note bottom of UC5
Search is available
through Web UI and CLI.
Multiple clients can
search concurrently.
end note
@enduml